Notes:
  Before starting the queqiaod service, please complete
the steps to initialize the trusted domains.

  Example:

    # sudo -u queqiao /usr/bin/queqiaod provider init \
    --state /var/lib/queqiao/provider \
    --name "Example Network" \
    --endpoint gateway.example.net:443

  For detailed information, please refer to 
https://github.com/bojieli/queqiao/blob/main/docs/DEPLOYING.md#install-the-gateway
